1. Vendored agent skills
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source of truth:   .github/skills-external/
Generated mirrors: .agents/skills/, .claude/skills/, .codex/skills/,
                   .opencode/skills/

These directories contain skills authored by third parties and vendored into
this repository by the sync engine (src/ml_python_base/skills_sync). The
mirrors are generated copies of the same upstream content, so a redistribution
of this repository redistributes each component five times. `skills-lock.json`
records content hashes and sync timestamps; it does not record provenance.
This file does.

1.1 Superpowers skill collection
    Upstream project: Superpowers (https://github.com/obra/superpowers)
    Upstream path:    skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md
    Author:           Jesse Vincent (obra)
    License:          MIT (see section 3 for the full text)
    Copyright:        Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse Vincent

    Components:
      brainstorming
      executing-plans
      finishing-a-development-branch
      requesting-code-review
      subagent-driven-development
      test-driven-development
      using-git-worktrees
      writing-plans

    Each of the eight is present under `skills/` in the upstream repository
    under that name. Seven also reference the upstream `superpowers:` skill
    namespace and `~/.config/superpowers/` directly in their SKILL.md.

1.2 ui-ux-pro-max
    Upstream project: UI/UX Pro Max Skill
                      (https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill)
    Upstream path:    .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md
    Author:           Next Level Builder (nextlevelbuilder)
    License:          MIT (see section 3 for the full text)
    Copyright:        Copyright (c) 2024 Next Level Builder

    Only SKILL.md is vendored here. The upstream skill also ships a `data/`
    directory (color, font, and chart catalogs, some carrying their own font
    licenses); none of it is present in this repository. If that data is ever
    imported, its licenses must be recorded here at that time.

1.3 writing-clearly-and-concisely
    Upstream project: NOT CONFIRMED.
    Author:           NOT CONFIRMED.
    License:          NOT CONFIRMED.

    This component was vendored alongside the Superpowers collection and is
    attributed to it by sync origin, but it does not appear under `skills/` in
    obra/superpowers as of 2026-08-20, and it carries no author or license
    frontmatter of its own. Its terms MUST be confirmed and recorded here --
    including the upstream copyright notice, if its license requires retaining
    one -- or the component removed, before this repository is redistributed.

    Its bundled `elements-of-style.md` is covered separately by section 2.

